    "Collected on Stellar. OpenSea doesn't list Stellar; add an edition to Freighter to see it there." : {
      "comment" : "Under the editions of My Moments on Stellar. OpenSea, Stellar and Freighter are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Collected on Stellar. OpenSea doesn't list Stellar; add an edition to Freighter to see it there."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Coleccionado en Stellar. OpenSea no lista Stellar; añade una edición a Freighter para verla allí."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Collecté sur Stellar. OpenSea ne liste pas Stellar ; ajoutez une édition à Freighter pour l'y voir."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收藏于 Stellar。OpenSea 不支持 Stellar；将版本添加到 Freighter 即可在那里查看。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Stellar에서 수집했어요. OpenSea는 Stellar를 지원하지 않아요. Freighter에 에디션을 추가하면 거기서 볼 수 있어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
