    "Legacy editions from DyorHQ's first Stellar Moments contract. Collecting is closed; editions stay with their collectors." : {
      "comment" : "Under the Retired heading of the Moments board on Stellar. DyorHQ and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Legacy editions from DyorHQ's first Stellar Moments contract. Collecting is closed; editions stay with their collectors."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ediciones heredadas del primer contrato de Moments de DyorHQ en Stellar. Ya no se puede coleccionar; las ediciones siguen con sus coleccionistas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Éditions héritées du premier contrat Moments de DyorHQ sur Stellar. La collecte est fermée ; les éditions restent à leurs collectionneurs."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来自 DyorHQ 首个 Stellar Moments 合约的旧版版本。收藏已关闭；版本仍归收藏者所有。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ의 첫 Stellar Moments 컨트랙트의 레거시 에디션이에요. 수집은 종료되었고, 에디션은 수집자에게 그대로 남아요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Legacy editions from DyorHQ's first Stellar Moments contract: view them and add them to Freighter. Collecting is closed." : {
      "comment" : "Under the Retired section of My Moments on Stellar. DyorHQ, Stellar and Freighter are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Legacy editions from DyorHQ's first Stellar Moments contract: view them and add them to Freighter. Collecting is closed."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Ediciones heredadas del primer contrato de Moments de DyorHQ en Stellar: velas y añádelas a Freighter. Ya no se puede coleccionar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Éditions héritées du premier contrat Moments de DyorHQ sur Stellar : consultez-les et ajoutez-les à Freighter. La collecte est fermée."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "来自 DyorHQ 首个 Stellar Moments 合约的旧版版本：可查看并添加到 Freighter。收藏已关闭。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ의 첫 Stellar Moments 컨트랙트의 레거시 에디션이에요. 확인하고 Freighter에 추가할 수 있어요. 수집은 종료되었어요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "New Moments appear here once the DyorHQ Moments contract is live on Stellar." : {
      "comment" : "The Moments board on Stellar while the network has no DyorHQ Moments contract. DyorHQ and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "New Moments appear here once the DyorHQ Moments contract is live on Stellar."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los nuevos Moments aparecerán aquí cuando el contrato de Moments de DyorHQ esté activo en Stellar."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Les nouveaux Moments apparaîtront ici dès que le contrat Moments de DyorHQ sera actif sur Stellar."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ Moments 合约在 Stellar 上线后，新的 Moment 会显示在这里。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "DyorHQ Moments 컨트랙트가 Stellar에 배포되면 새 Moment가 여기에 표시돼요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Publish a photo or video as an NFT on Stellar. Share it with everyone and earn every time it's collected." : {
      "comment" : "Under the Moments board's title on Stellar. NFT and Stellar are never translated",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Publish a photo or video as an NFT on Stellar. Share it with everyone and earn every time it's collected."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Publica una foto o un video como NFT en Stellar. Compártelo con todos y gana cada vez que lo coleccionen."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Publiez une photo ou une vidéo en NFT sur Stellar. Partagez-la avec tout le monde et gagnez à chaque collecte."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Stellar 上将照片或视频发布为 NFT。分享给所有人，每次被收藏都能获得收益。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "사진이나 동영상을 Stellar에 NFT로 게시하세요. 모두와 공유하고, 수집될 때마다 수익을 얻으세요."
          }
        }
      }
    },
